<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>a link is blue (#0000EE) and underlined</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.4: :link { color: LinkText (#0000EE in light mode) }, a:link { text-decoration: underline }. Needs href on a (E-XML-2)."/>
</head>
<body><p>see <a href="https://example.com/">the link</a> here</p>
</body>
</html>
